ring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Siz oʻz kalitingizdan foydalanasiz, shuning uchun isteʼmolingiz uchun toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri provayderga toʻlaysiz. Ishonchingiz komil emasmi? Bularning barchasi yaxshi ishlaydi; keyinroq yana qoʻshishingiz mumkin.','Next'=>'Keyingi','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'2-qadam: %s ni ulang','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'OpenAI-mos keluvchi xizmatingiz manzilini oxirida /v1 bilan kiriting. Kalit faqat xizmat uni talab qilgandagina kerak bo\'ladi.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'%s ni oching va tizimga kiring (yoki bepul hisob yarating).','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API kalitlari sahifasi','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Yangi kalit yarating va uni nusxalang.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Uni quyida qo\'ying va "Saqlash va sinash" tugmasini bosing. Uning ishlashini tekshirish uchun bitta kichik so\'rov yuboramiz.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Aksar provayderlar kalit ishlashi uchun hisobda biroz mablag‘ talab qiladi: %s.','add credit'=>'hisobni to\'ldirish','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Boshqa provayderni tanlash','Address'=>'Manzil','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Saqlangan kalit …%s bilan tugaydi — uning o\'rniga yangisini qo\'ying','Key (optional)'=>'Kalit (ixtiyoriy)','API key'=>'API kaliti','Save and test'=>'Saqlash va sinovdan o\'tkazish','Providers'=>'Provayderlar','Provider'=>'Provayder','Status'=>'Holat','Key'=>'Kalit','Get a key'=>'Kalitni olish','Test'=>'Sinov','Remove'=>'Olib tashlash','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Yangiroq plagin versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan: ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Saqlangan kalitni endi ochib bo\'lmaydi (saytning xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni qayta kiriting.','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ulangan — oxirgi sinovdan o\'tdi %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Oxirgi sinov muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ulangan — hali sinovdan o‘tkazilmagan','Which model to use'=>'Qaysi modeldan foydalanish kerak','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ bu vazifa uchun tavsiyamizni bildiradi. Roʻyxat kalitingiz foydalanishi mumkin boʻlgan barcha modellarni oʻz ichiga oladi va ular provayderdan jonli oʻqib olinadi.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Provayder uchun tavsiya etiladi —','Save models'=>'Modellarni saqlash','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ta\'minotchilardan model ro\'yxatlarini yangilash','Images'=>'Rasmlar','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Tasvirlar yaratish uchun OpenAI yoki Google Gemini\'ni ulang.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Birinchi ulinlangan provayderning eng yangi tasvir modeli —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Saytda qidiruv (embendinglar)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Saytingiz uchun qidiruv indeksini yaratish uchun Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki OpenRouter\'ni ulang.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Birinchi ulangan provayderning eng so‘nggi embedding modeli —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Buni o\'zgartirish undan foydalanadigan har bir plaginning qidiruv indeksini qayta tiklaydi.','best quality'=>'eng yaxshi sifat','lowest cost'=>'eng arzon narx','fastest'=>'eng tez','Add a model yourself'=>'Modelni o\'zingiz qo\'shing','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Bugun yangi model chiqdimi? Uni darhol ishlatish uchun uning aniq nomini kiriting.','Model name'=>'Model nomi','Add model'=>'Model qo\'shish','Recommended models list'=>'Tavsi etilgan modellar ro\'yxati','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Tavsiya etilgan modellar roʻyxatini tekshirib boʻlmadi, shuning uchun hech qanday tavsiya koʻrsatilmagan. Plaginni qayta oʻrnating yoki quyida kundalik yangilanishlarni yoqing.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Foydalanilayotgan roʻyxat %s da eʼlon qilingan. Har bir plagin yangilanishi yangisini olib keladi.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Yangilangan roʻyxat uchun kuniga bir marta Zinn Digital® ni ham tekshirib turing.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Faqat oddiy yuklab olish soʻrovi yuboriladi: kalit ham, sayt manzili ham, kontentingiz haqida hech narsa yuborilmaydi. Roʻyxat imzolanadi va imzo tekshiruvidan oʻta olmagan roʻyxat eʼtiborga olinmaydi.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Oxirgi marta tekshirilgan vaqt %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Saqlang va yoqilgan bo\'lsa, hoziroq tekshiring','a newer list was installed'=>'yangiroq ro\'yxat o\'rnatildi','already up to date'=>'allaqachon yangilangan','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'yuklab olish imzo tekshiruvidan o‘tmadi va e’tiborga olinmadi','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi; joriy ro‘yxat ishlatilishda davom etadi','turned off'=>'o\'chirilgan','Open'=>'Ochish','Check their status page'=>'Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring','Open your billing page'=>'Hisob-kitob sahifangizni oching','Open your API keys page'=>'API kalitlari sahifasini oching','Open the AI settings'=>'AI sozlamalarini ochish','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Kechirasiz, buni qilishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','Unknown provider.'=>'Noma\'lum provayder.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Xizmatingiz manzilini kiriting, masalan, http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Bu API kalitiga o\'xshamaydi. Uni probelsiz holda qayta nusxalang.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Avval API kalitingizni qo\'ying.','Key removed.'=>'Kalit olib tashlandi.','Models saved.'=>'Modellar saqlandi.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Modelning aniq nomini kiriting, masalan, provayder hujjatlarida yozilganidek.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'%s qo\'shildi. Uni "Qaysi modeldan foydalanish" ostidan tanlang.','Model removed.'=>'Model olib tashlandi.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Kunlik yangilanishlar o‘chirilgan. Plagin bilan birga kelgan ro‘yxat ishlatiladi.','Checked: %s.'=>'Tekshirildi: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Model roʻyxatlari yangilandi.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Sizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz plaginlaringizdan birining yangiroq versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan. Ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Saqlangan AI kalitingizni ochib bo\'lmaydi (sayt xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni AI sozlamalarida qaytadan kiriting.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt hali sozlangan emas. AI sozlamalarida sun\'iy intellekt provayderi uchun kalit qo\'shing.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Bu vazifa uchun hech qanday model tanlanmagan. AI sozlamalaridan birini tanlang.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi plaginning ushbu versiyasi tomonidan qo\'llab-quvvatlanmaydi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Tasvir yaratish imkoniyatiga ega sun\'iy intellekt provayderi ulanmagan. Sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida OpenAI yoki Google Gemini kalitini qo\'shing.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi tasvirlar yarata olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida tasvirlar uchun OpenAI yoki Google Gemini ni tanlang.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Sizning AI kalitingiz biron bir rasm modelidan foydalana olmaydi. Kalitning ruxsatlarini provayder bilan tekshiring yoki rasmlar uchun boshqa provayderni tanlang.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ulangan sun\'iy intellekt provayderi qidiruv indeksini yarata olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki OpenRouter kalitini qo\'shing.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Sizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz hech qanday vektorli modellikdan foydalana olmaydi. Provayder bilan kalit ruxsatlarini tekshiring yoki sayt qidiruvi uchun boshqa provayderni tanlang.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi qidiruv indeksini yarata olmaydi. Saytda qidirish uchun Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki mos keluvchi xizmatni ulang.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Bu sayt sizning sun\'iy intellekt xizmatingizga ulanolmadi. U ishlayotganini va uning manziliga veb-serveringizdan ulanish mumkinligini tekshiring (shaxsiy kompyuteringizdagi xizmatga xostdagi saytdan ulanib bo\'lmaydi).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Ushbu sayt %s manziliga ulanolmadi. Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring; agar u ishlayotgan bo\'lsa, xostingiz chiquvchi ulanishlarni bloklayotgan bo\'lishi mumkin yoki manzil noto\'g\'ri.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s hisobingizda mablagʻ yoki kvota qolmaganini bildiradi. Ularning hisobidan mablagʻ qoʻshing yoki limitni oshiring, soʻngra qaytadan urinib koʻring.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kalitingizni qabul qilmadi. U xato kiritilgan, bekor qilingan yoki muddati tugagan bo\'lishi mumkin. Yangi kalit yarating va uni shu yerga qo\'ying.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kalitingiz uchun qilingan ushbu so‘rovni rad etdi. Kalit ushbu model yoki funksiyaga kirish huquqiga ega bo‘lmasligi mumkin yoki hisobingizni tasdiqlash talab etiladi.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Sizning kalitingiz uchun "%1$s" modeli %2$s tomonidan taqdim etilmaydi. Sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalaridan boshqa modelni tanlang.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Sizning %2$s rejangiz "%1$s" modelini o\'z ichiga olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida boshqa modelni tanlang yoki rejangizni ular bilan yangilang.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s kalitingiz soʻrovlarni yuborish tezligini cheklamoqda. Bir daqiqa kutib, qaytadan urinib koʻring yoki ular bilan limitni oshiring.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s bilan hozirda muammolar mavjud (ularning tomonidan uzilish yoki haddan tashqari yuklanish). Sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xatolik yo\'q. Qisqa vaqtdan keyin yana urinib ko\'ring.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovi biz aniqlay olmagan sababga ko\'ra bajarilmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko\'ring; agar muammo takrorlanaversa, quyidagi ma\'lumotlar bilan qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI provayderi ushbu plagin o‘qiy olmaydigan shaklda javob berdi. Qaytadan urinib ko‘ring; agar bu holat takrorlanaversa, boshqa modelni tanlang yoki yordam xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maxsus (OpenAI-mos keluvchi)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Avval ushbu provayder uchun kalitni saqlang.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Kalitingiz ishlayapti, ammo provayder unda matnli modelni koʻrsatmagan. Quyida oʻzingiz model qoʻshing.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ulangan. %1$s %2$s yordamida javob berdi. Sun\'iy intellekt funksiyalaringiz foydalanishga tayyor.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Sizning foydalanuvchi rolingizga ushbu saytda sun\'iy intellektdan foydalanishga ruxsat etilmagan. Administratorga murojaat qiling.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sayt oylik sun\'iy intellekt xarajatlari limitiga yetdi. Administrator buni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sayt sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovlarining oylik limitiga yetdi. Administrator buni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','Usage and cost'=>'Foydalanish va narx','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Jurnal, cheklovlar va rol ruxsatlari quyidagi orqali ishlatiladigan sun\'iy intellektga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Xarajatlar taxminiy bo\'lib, e\'lon qilingan narxlardan kelib chiqqan holda hisoblangan; narxi noma\'lum bo\'lgan model nolga teng deb olinadi.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bu oy: %1$s soʻrov, taxminan %2$s.','When'=>'Qachon','Who'=>'Kim','Used for'=>'Quyidagilar uchun ishlatiladi','Model'=>'Model','Tokens in / out'=>'Kiruvchi / chiquvchi tokenlar','About'=>'Haqida','Result'=>'Natija','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovlari yuborilmagan.','Done'=>'Bajarildi','Limits and permissions'=>'Chegaralar va ruxsatlar','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Oylik xarajat limiti (US dollari)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Cheksiz qoldirish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring. Taxminiy xarajat unga yetganda AI oyning qolgan qismi uchun to\'xtaydi.','Monthly request limit'=>'Oylik soʻrovlar limiti','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Cheklash qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Who may use AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellektdan kimlar foydalanishi mumkin','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Plagin funksiyalaridan foydalana oladigan har bir kishi sun\'iy intellektdan foydalanishiga ruxsat berish uchun hech birini beliralamang. Administratorlar undan doimo foydalanishi mumkin.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Cheklovlar va ruxsatlarni saqlash','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Cheklovlar va ruxsatlar saqlandi.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Xavfsizlik xatosi, sahifani yangilang va qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Axborotnoma sozlamalari topilmadi. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Yangiliklar tasmasi sozlamalari noto\'g\'ri. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Invalid email address.'=>'Yaroqsiz elektron pochta manzili.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Obuna bo\'lishdan oldin rozi bo\'lish uchun katakchani belgilang.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Urinishlar soni juda ko\'p. Iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Nimadir xato ketdi. Iltimos, administrator bilan bog\'laning.','Map'=>'Bog‘lash','Background video'=>'Fon video','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d ta shrift fayli saqlangan, %3$s uslublar jadvali','That family is not stored.'=>'Bu oila saqlanmagan.','Removed.'=>'O\'chirilgan.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Bu yaroqli shrift oilasi nomi emas.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts bu shriftlar oilasini qaytarmadi. Nomini tekshiring va qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Shrift fayllarini yuklab oling yoki saqlab bo\'lmadi. Yuklashlar papkasiga yozib bo\'lishini tekshiring.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Shrift uslublar jadvalini saqlab bo‘lmadi. Yuklashlar papkasiga yozish mumkinligini tekshiring.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Ushbu xabarnomani yopish','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yangi oynada ochiladi)','Done:'=>'Bajarildi:','To do:'=>'Bajarilishi kerak:','Glossary index'=>'Lug‘at ko‘rsatkichi','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'%2$s tadan %1$s baholandi','Progress'=>'Jarayon','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Kodni nusxalash','Copied'=>'Nusxa olindi','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Bu vidjet ushbu saytda mavjud emas.','Email'=>'Elektron pochta','Phone'=>'Telefon','RSS feed'=>'RSS-lenta','Website'=>'Veb-sayt','Link'=>'Havola','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (yangi tabda ochiladi)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'5 dan %d ta baholandi','(recommended)'=>'(tavsiya etiladi)','Included'=>'Kiritilgan','Not included'=>'Kiritilmagan','Comparison table'=>'Taqqoslash jadvali','Call %s'=>'%s ga qo\'ng\'iroq qilish','Email %s'=>'Elektron pochta %s','Text %s'=>'Matn %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp\'da chat qilish','Contact us'=>'Biz bilan bog‘laning','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp orqali biz bilan chat qiling','This form is not available right now.'=>'Bu forma hozirda mavjud emas.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'%s faol bo\'lmagani sababli ushbu formani ko\'rsatib bo\'lmaydi.','Map: %s'=>'Bog\'lanish: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Xaritani ko‘rsatish uni OpenStreetMap\'dan yuklaydi.','Show the map'=>'Xaritani koʻrsatish','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'OpenStreetMap\'da xaritani ochish','Booking calendar from %s'=>'%s dan bron qilish taqvimi','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Band qilish taqvimini ko\'rsatish uni %s dan yuklaydi.','Show the booking calendar'=>'Band qilish taqvimini ko‘rsatish','Book on %s'=>'%s da band qilish','QR code for %s'=>'%s uchun QR-kod','Design'=>'Dizayn','Content'=>'Kontent','Media'=>'Media','Marketing'=>'Marketing','Site'=>'Sayt','Data'=>'Maʼlumotlar','Affiliate & iGaming'=>'Hamkorlik va iGaming','Related posts'=>'Tegishli xabarlar','Post details'=>'Xabar tafsilotlari','By'=>'Muallif:','Published'=>'Nashr etilgan','Updated'=>'Yangilangan','In'=>'Ichida','Tagged'=>'Teg qo\'yilgan','%d minute read'=>'%d daqiqalik o\'qish' . "\0" . '%d daqiqalik o\'qish','No comments yet'=>'Hozircha izohlar yo‘q','%d comment'=>'%d ta izoh' . "\0" . '%d ta izoh','Sitemap'=>'Sayt xaritasi','(no title)'=>'(sarlavhasiz)','All posts by %s'=>'%s ga tegishli barcha xabarlar','This content is protected. Enter the password to see it.'=>'Bu kontent himoyalangan. Uni ko\'rish uchun parolni kiriting.','That password is not right. Try again.'=>'Ushbu parol noto‘g‘ri. Qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.','Password'=>'Parol','Show the content'=>'Kontentni ko\'rsatish','That page cannot be unlocked.'=>'Bu sahifani qulfdan chiqarib bo‘lmaydi.','Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Urinishlar soni juda ko\'p. Bir necha daqiqa kutib, qayta urinib ko\'ring.','The password must be 4 to 200 characters long.'=>'Parol 4 tadan 200 tagacha belgidan iborat bo‘lishi kerak.','More'=>'Ko\'proq','Close'=>'Yopish','Tab %d'=>'Varaqa %d','Contents'=>'Mundarija','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'PlaginningUshbu nusxasidagi admin ekranining skriptlari yetishmayapti. Uni chiqarilgan paketdan qaytadan o\'rnating.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ushbu ekran uchun JavaScript talab qilinadi.','Languages'=>'Tillar','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Hosting mijozisemisiz? %2$s dan %1$d%% chegirma oling','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Zinn Digital® xosting mijosi sifatida siz birinchi to‘lovingiz uchun %d%% chegirma olasiz. Keyingi to‘lovlar odatiy narxda amalga oshiriladi.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'%d%% kodimni oling va to\'lov sahifasiga o\'ting','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Bu chegirma faol va to‘lovi qilingan hosting rejasiga ega mijozlar uchun amal qiladi. Bepul sinov muddatlari buni qamrab olmaydi.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Siz ushbu plagin uchun xosting mijozlari chegirmasidan allaqachon foylangansiz.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kodingizni hozircha olib bo\'lmadi. Iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Prefiks 1 dan 8 gacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlardan iborat bo\'lishi, harf bilan boshlanishi va plagin nomiga teng bo\'lmasligi kerak.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Ushbu elementni tahrirlashga ruxsatingiz yoʻq.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Buni qilishga ruxsat etilmagan.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim o\'chirildi, chunki u endi sizning kirishingizga mos kelmaydi. Sahifani qayta yuklang.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Faqat administrator xavfsiz rejimdan foydalana oladi.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim odatiy brauzer orqali kirishni talab qiladi.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni oʻrnatib boʻlmadi.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim wp-content/mu-plugins papkasiga yozish huquqiga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim wp-content/mu-plugins papkasiga yoza olmadi.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Bu sahifa mavjud emas yoki o‘chirib yuborilgan.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio blok muharriri bilan ishlaydi, va ushbu element uchun blok muharriri o\'chirilgan. Classic Editor kabi plagin shunday qiladi: uning sozlamalarida ushbu element uchun blok muharririga ruxsat bering (Sozlamalar → Yozish), so\'ngra Sandwich Studio\'ni qaytadan oching.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Kechirasiz, sizga Sandwich Studio’da bu elementni tahrirlashga ruxsat etilmagan.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio o\'rnatilmagan. Plaginni qaytadan o\'rnating.','Add title'=>'Sarlavha qo\'shish','Type / to choose a block'=>'Blokni tanlash uchun / kiriting','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Sandwich Studio yuklanmoqda…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio uchun JavaScript kerak. Buning o\'rniga oddiy tahrirlagichni ishlating.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'“%s” nomini Sandwich Studio yordamida tahrirlash','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio bilan tahrirlash','Blank canvas'=>'Bo\'sh sahifa','Skip to content'=>'Asosiy qismga o\'tish','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Planshet kengligi 480 dan 2560 gacha bo\'lgan butun piksellar sonidan iborat bo\'lishi kerak.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Mobil eni butun piksel soni bo\'lishi kerak, kamida 240 va planshet enidan kichik bo\'lishi lozim.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Har bir maxsus nuqta o\'z id raqamiga ega bo\'lishi kerak: harfdan boshlanadigan 2 dan 12 tagacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlar.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Maxsus nuqta (breakpoint) yo faqat maʼlum bir kenglikkacha (200 dan 4000 pikselsacha) yoki maʼlum bir kenglikdan boshlab (200 dan 6000 pikselsacha) qo\'llaniladi, ikkalasi bir vaqtning o\'zida emas.','Tablet'=>'Planshet','Mobile'=>'Mobil','Site design'=>'Sayt dizayni','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Saytning har bir sahifasi va uslubingiz tomonidan umumiy foydalaniladigan ranglar, shriftlar va uslublar.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Saytning global uslublarini ochib boʻlmadi.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Bu shrift sayt shriftlaridan biri emas.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Har bir rang kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan iborat noyob nomga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'"%s" rangi yaroqli CSS rangi emas.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Har bir shrift kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan iborat noyob nomga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'"%s" uchun shriftlar toʻplamida faqat shrift nomlari, qoʻshtirnoqlar, vergullar va boʻshliqlar boʻlishi mumkin.','Uploaded icons'=>'Yuklangan nishonchalar','Icon'=>'Nishon','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Bu fayl biz foydalana oladigan SVG ikonka emas. U shikastlangan bo\'lishi mumkin yoki xavfsizlik maqsadida olib tashlangan tarkibni (skriptlar, havolalar, o\'rnatilgan rasmlar yoki shriftlar) o\'z ichiga olgan bo\'lishi mumkin.','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Belgini o\'chirib bo\'lmadi.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'litsenziya kaliti','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Litsenziya bilan hali foydalanuvchi bog\'lanmagan, bu ruxsatsiz faollashtirishning oldini olish uchun zarur. Litsenziyani o\'z foydalanuvchingizga biriktirish orqali siz WordPress foydalanuvchingizning to\'liq ismi va elektron pochta manzilini ulashishga rozilik bildirasiz.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'yuqorida tilga olingan saytlar','Account'=>'Hisob','Account Details'=>'Hisob Ma\'lumotlari','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Hisobni faollashtirish kutilmoqda. Iltimos, elektron pochtangizni tekshiring va hisobingizni faollashtirish uchun havodolani bosing, so\'ngra hamkorlik formasini qaytadan yuboring.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'%1$s ni %2$s bilan birlashtirmoqchimisiz?','Actions'=>'Amallar','Activate'=>'Faollashtirish','Activate Free Version'=>'Bepul versiyani faollashtirish','Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish','activate a license here'=>'litsenziyani shu yerda faollashtirish','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Xarid qilganingizdan keyin darhol elektron pochtangizga kelgan litsenziya kalitini kiriting:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'%1$s ning pullik versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. %2$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun uni faollashtiring. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'%1$s ning pulli versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. Uni faollashtirish va %3$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun %2$s bo\'limiga o\'ting.','Activate this add-on'=>'Ushbu qo‘shimchani faollashtirish','Activate %s'=>'%s ni faol