e your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng, agar uni yaroqli premium litsenziya bilan qaytadan faollashtirmasangiz, %s dan foydalana olmaysiz.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Siz hali ham barcha %1$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishingiz mumkin, lekin %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlariga, shuningdek, qo‘llab-quvvatlashga ega bo‘lmaysiz.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bepul %1$s davridan keyin %2$s dan boshlab to‘lang','Agree & Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani qabul qilish va faollashtirish','I Agree - Change User'=>'Roziman - Foydalanuvchini o‘zgartirish','All Requests'=>'Barcha soʻrovlar','All Types'=>'Barcha turlar','allow'=>'ruxsat berish','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Siz %s ni yaxshilashga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga allaqachon rozilik bildirgansiz.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Siz allaqachon ularni yanada yaxshilashimizga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozi bo‘lgansiz.','Amount'=>'Miqdor','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Yillik','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Yillik','Anonymous feedback'=>'Anonim fikr-mulohaza','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarga qo\'llash.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarga nisbatan qo\'llash.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo\'lish uchun ariza topshiring','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Tasdiqlash va sinov muddatini boshlash','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Takomillashishimiz uchun iltimos sababini ayting.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Yangilash uchun foydalangan elektron pochta manzilingizni quyida kiriting va biz litsenziya kalitini qayta yuboramiz.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Xarid qilishda foydalangan elektron pochta manzilingizni kiriting va biz litsenziya kalitini sizga qayta yuboramiz.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Litsenziya egasining hisobiga ulang.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Muallif','Invalid module ID.'=>'Noto\'g\'ri modul identifikatori.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Sizda premium versiyaga kirish uchun amal qiladigan litsenziya mavjud emas.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Avtomatik o‘rnatish faqat tanlagan foydalanuvchilar uchun ishlaydi.','Premium version already active.'=>'Premium versiya allaqachon faol.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Premium qo\'shimcha versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plagin "Serviceware" hisoblanadi, ya\'ni uning pullik kod versiyasi mavjud emas.','Automatic Installation'=>'Avtomatik oʻrnatish','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Avtomatik o‘chish vaqti:','Average Rating'=>'O\'rtacha baho','Awesome'=>'Ajoyib','based on %s'=>'%s asosida','Become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo‘lish','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'%s yoqdimi? Bizning elchimiz bo\'ling va pul ishlang ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Salom, %1$s hamkorlik dasturiga ega ekanligini bilarmidingiz? Agar %2$s sizga yoqsa, bizning elchimizga aylaning va pul ishlang!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Eng yaxshi','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Beta versiyasiga yangilash %s ning o\'rnatilgan versiyasini eng so\'nggi Beta versiyasi bilan almashtiradi - ehtiyotkorlik bilan foydalaning va uni produktiv (ishlab chiqarish) saytlarida ishlatmang. Siz ogohlantirildingiz.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'%s bo‘yicha hisob-kitob qilingan','Billing'=>'Hisob-kitob','Billing & Invoices'=>'Hisob-kitoblar va schyotlar','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Bloklangan','Blocking'=>'Bloklanmoqda','Blog ID'=>'Blog ID','Body'=>'Asosiy qism','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ha - ikkala manzil ham o\'zimniki','Bundle'=>'To‘plam','Bundle Plan'=>'To\'plam rejasi','Business name'=>'Biznes nomi','Buy license'=>'Litsenziyani sotib olish','Buy a license now'=>'Hozir litsenziya sotib oling','Cancel'=>'Bekor qilish','Cancel Installation'=>'O\'rnatishni bekor qilish','Cancel Subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Agar siz bu %1$s ni ushbu saytda (yoki boshqa biron bir saytda) ishlatishni rejalashtirmayotgan boʻlsangiz, shuningdek %2$s ni ham bekor qilishni xohlaysizmi?','Cancel Trial'=>'Sinov muddatini bekor qilish','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Sinov muddatini bekor qilish barcha premium funksiyalarga kirishni darhol bloklaydi. Ishonchingiz komilmi?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'%s ni bekor qilish va davom etish','Cancelled'=>'Bekor qilingan','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Litsenziya kalitingizni topa olmadingizmi?','Change License'=>'Litsenziyani o\'zgartirish','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'%s manziliga tasdiqlash xati yuborildi. Yangilanishni keyingi 4 soat ichida tasdiqlashingiz kerak. Agar xatni topa olmasangiz, spam papkasini tekshiring.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Tasdiqlash xati hozirgina %s manziliga yuborildi. Xat egasi yangilanishni keyingi 4 soat ichida tasdiqlashi shart.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s hisobning yangi egasi.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Egalik huquqining o\'zgarishini tasdiqlaganingiz uchun tashakkur. Yakuniy tasdiqlash uchun %s manziliga hozirgina xat yuborildi.','Change Ownership'=>'Egarlik huquqini o\'zgartirish','Change Plan'=>'Tarifni o‘zgartirish','Change User'=>'Foydalanuvchini oʻzgartirish','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish orqali siz hisob egaligini quyidagiga o\'tkazishga rozilik bildirasiz:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'O‘zgarishlar tarixi','Changing user, please wait'=>'Foydalanuvchi oʻzgartirilmoqda, iltimos kuting','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Agar xatni olmagan bo\'lsangiz, spam papkasini tekshirib ko\'ring yoki %4$s tomonidan yuborilgan xatlarni qidiring.','Checkout'=>'Rasmiylashtirish','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish uchun %s tagacha saytni tanlang.','City'=>'Shahar','Clear API Cache'=>'API keshini tozalash','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Yangilanish vaqtinchalik ma\'lumotlarini tozalash','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bu yerni bosing','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Plagindan anonim ravishda foydalanish uchun bu yerni bosing','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'%s ball qo\'yilgan sharhlarni ko\'rish uchun bosing','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s – mijozimning elektron pochta manzili','Code'=>'Kod','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Mijoz yangi litsenziya sotib olganda %s komissiya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Potensial qaytarishlar uchun 30 kunni saqlab qolganimiz sababli, biz faqat 30 kundan oshgan komissiyalarni to\'laymiz.','Communication'=>'Aloqa','Compatible up to'=>'Quyidagicha mos keladi','complete the opt-in'=>'obunani yakunlash','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Tabriklaymiz','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s ga yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiyalar yangilanishlari, o‘quv qo‘llanmalari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti ma\'lumotlarini ulashish uchun ro‘yxatdan o‘ting. Bu bizga %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, oʻquv materiallari hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar boʻyicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida baʼzi maʼlumotlarni ulashish uchun roʻyxatdan oʻting.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham muammo yo\'q! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormasligingiz va %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq hamda siz xohlagan vazifalarni bajarishda samaraliroq qilishimizga yordam berish uchun ushbu ixtiyoriy funksiyani joriy qildik.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Freemius tarmoq darajasidagi integratsiyasini taqdim etishdan mamnunmiz.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida tarmoqda hali e\'tiboringizni talab qiladigan %s ta sayt aniqlandi.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida litsenziyasi faollashtirilishi kutilayotgan %d ta sayt aniqlandi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Agar siz ushbu saytlarda %s dan foydalanishni istasangiz, iltimos, litsenziya kalitingizni quyiga kiriting va faollashtirish tugmasini bosing.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Shuningdek, buni hozircha oʻtkazib yuborishingiz va litsenziyani keyinroq %s tarmogʻi darajasidagi Hisob qaydnomasi sahifasida faollashtirishingiz mumkin.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ulentgan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Tugatganingizdan so\'ng, %s ni o\'chiring va uni qayta yoqing.','Contact'=>'Aloqa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksional yangilanishlar, o\'quv materiallari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar yuzasidan siz bilan bog\'lanishimizni istasangiz, iltimos, bizga xabar bering:','Contact Support'=>'Yordam xizmati bilan bog\'lanish','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Noqulaylik uchun uzr so\'raymiz va agar bizga imkon bersangiz, yordam berishga tayyormiz.','Contact Us'=>'Biz bilan bog‘laning','Please contact us here'=>'Biz bilan shu yerda bog\'laning','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Iltimos, quyidagi xabar bilan biz bilan bog\'laning:','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Contributors'=>'Ishtirokchilar','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'%s ni faollashtirib bo‘lmadi.','Country'=>'Mamlakat','Cron Type'=>'Cron turi','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Biz API chaqiruvlari uchun juda keng tarqalgan va odatda o\'rnatilgan hamda sukut bo\'yicha faollashtirilgan PHP cURL kutubxonasidan foydalanamiz. Afsuski, cURL serveringizda faollashtirilmagan (yoki o\'chirilgan).','data'=>'ma\'lumotlar','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Nosozliklarni tuzatish rejimi muvaffaqiyatli yoqildi va 60 daqiqadan so\'ng avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi. Shuningdek, "Debugni to\'xtatish" havolasini bosish orqali uni ertaroq o\'chirishingiz mumkin.','Date'=>'Sana','Deactivate'=>'Faollashtirmaslik','Deactivate the free version'=>'Bepul versiyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivate License'=>'Litsenziyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Litsenziyangizni faolsizlantirish barcha premium funksiyalarni bloklaydi, biroq litsenziyani boshqa saytda faollashtirish imkonini beradi. Davom etishni xohlayotganingizga aminmisiz?','Deactivation'=>'Faollashtirmasizlik','Yes - %s'=>'Ha - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Yuborish va %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'%s ni oʻchirish yoki olib tashlash litsenziyani avtomatik ravishda faolsizlantiradi, shunda uni boshqa saytda ishlatishingiz mumkin boʻladi.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Agar biroz vaqtingi