ption (required)'=>'Tavsif (majburiy)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Model nima koʻrsatsa: bu ekran oʻquvchi dastur e’lon qiladigan narsadir.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Yuklanayotganda ko\'rsatiladigan afisha rasmi','Turn slowly on its own'=>'O\'z-o\'zidan asta-sekin aylanadi','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Telefonlarda "joyingizda ko‘rish" (AR) funksiyasini taklif qiling','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Yon paneldan 3D modelni tanlang.','Choose a menu…'=>'Menuni tanlang…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Faqat sayt menyularini tahrirlay oladigan odamlar bu yerdan birini tanlashi mumkin.','Navigation menu'=>'Navigatsiya menyusi','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'Qaysi WordPress menyusini ko\'rsatishni tanlang.','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'Bu saytda hali menyular yoʻq. Bittasini yarating, keyin uni bu yerdan tanlang.','Edit menus'=>'Menularni tahrirlash','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'Ekran o‘quvchi foydalanuvchilariga bu qaysi menyu ekanligini, masalan, “Asosiy” yoki “Pastki qism” ekanligini bildiradi.','Direction'=>'Yo\'nalish','In a row'=>'Bir qatorda','In a column'=>'Ustunda','Mobile menu button'=>'Mobil menyu tugmasi','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it over the page.'=>'Ushbu enidan pastda menyu sahifa ustida ochiladigan tugmaga aylanadi.','On phones'=>'Telefonlarda','On phones and tablets'=>'Telefon va planshetlarda','Always'=>'Har doim','Never'=>'Hech qachon','Open submenus'=>'Ochiladigan pastki menyular','When the arrow is clicked'=>'Streka bosilganda','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'Kursor olib borilganda yoki strelka bosilganda','Mega menus'=>'Mega menyular','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-level item, instead of its submenu. Add a panel below the menu and choose its item.'=>'Mega menyu pastki menyu o‘rniga eng yuqori d