)','Choose images'=>'Rasmlarni tanlash','Content type'=>'Kontent turi','Items per page'=>'Sahifadagi elementlar soni','Only these categories'=>'Faqat ushbu toifalar','None chosen: every category.'=>'Hech biri tanlanmagan: barcha toifalar.','Oldest first'=>'Avval eskilari','Title, A to Z'=>'Sarlavha, A dan Z gacha','Recently updated'=>'Yaqinda yangilangan','Custom order'=>'Maxsus buyurtma','Random'=>'Tasodifiy','Summary'=>'Xulosa','Price (products)'=>'Narx (mahsulotlar)','Card'=>'Karta','Previous and next buttons'=>'Oldingi va keyingi tugmalar','Start again after the last'=>'Oxirgisidan keyin qaytadan boshlash','Play automatically'=>'Avtomatik ijro etish','Never for visitors who prefer less motion; pauses on hover and focus, and has a Stop button.'=>'Kam harakatlanishni afzal ko\'radigan tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun hech qachon; sichqoncha kursorini olib borgan va fokuslanganda to\'xtaydi va To\'xtatish tugmasi mavjud.','Seconds per slide'=>'Har bir slayd uchun soniya','Move up'=>'Yuqoriga ko\'chirish','Move down'=>'Pastga koʻchirish','Remove column %s'=>'%s ustunini olib tashlash','The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces what is here.'=>'Birinchi qatorda ustun nomlari saqlanadi. Import qilish bu yerdagilarni almashtiradi.','Remove image'=>'Rasmni oʻchirish','%1$s %2$d'=>'%1$s %2$d','Pick the level that fits the outline of the page.'=>'Sahifa tuzilishiga mos keladigan darajani tanlang.','Replace photo'=>'Rasmni almashtirish','Move %s up'=>'%s ni yuqoriga ko\'chirish','Move %s down'=>'%s ni pastga koʻchirish','Duplicate %s'=>'%s nusxasini yaratish','Remove %s'=>'%s ni o\'chirish','Rating (0 to 5)'=>'Baholash (0 dan 5 gacha)','Highlights, one per line'=>'Diqqatga sazovor joylar, har bir qatorda bittadan','Optional, for example “Top pick”.'=>'Ixtiyoriy, masalan “Eng yaxshi tanlov”.','Terms (shown with the offer)'=>'Shartlar (taklif bilan birga ko\'rsatilgan)','The key terms your licence requires next to the offer, for example the wagering requirement.'=