'=>'Rasm','Photo: alternative text'=>'Surat: muqobil matn','Leave empty when the photo only repeats the name.'=>'Agar surat faqat nomni takrorlasa, bo\'sh qoldiring.','Profile links'=>'Profil havolalari','Add a link'=>'Havola qo\'shish','Network'=>'Tarmoq','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','X'=>'X','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Instagram'=>'Instagram','GitHub'=>'GitHub','YouTube'=>'YouTube','Mastodon'=>'Mastodon','Bluesky'=>'Bluesky','Team'=>'Jamoa','Add a person in the block settings.'=>'Blok sozlamalariga shaxsni qo\'shing.','Event'=>'Hodisa','Timeline'=>'Xronologiya','Add an event in the block settings.'=>'Blok sozlamalariga voqea qo\'shing.','Badges'=>'Nishonlar','Add a badge'=>'Nishon qo\'shish','Trust badges'=>'Ishonch belgicha','Row'=>'Qator','Add a badge in the block settings.'=>'Blok sozlamalariga nishon qo‘shing.','Videos'=>'Videolar','Add a video'=>'Video qo\'shish','Video address (YouTube, Vimeo or a file)'=>'Video manzil (YouTube, Vimeo yoki fayl)','Poster image (optional)'=>'Plakat rasmi (ixtiyoriy)','Replace poster'=>'Posterning oʻrnini almashtirish','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Yon panelga videolar qo‘shish.','Name of the list'=>'Ro‘yxat nomi','Web address or text'=>'Veb-manzil yoki matn','QR code'=>'QR kod','Description for screen readers'=>'Ekran o\'quvchilar uchun tavsif','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'"QR code for" va matndan foydalanish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Veb-manzil, telefon havolasi (tel:) yoki istalgan matnni kiriting.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Bu QR kod uchun juda uzun. Uni qisqartiring.','Add a caption'=>'Izoh qoʻshish','Reading progress bar'=>'O\'qish jarayoni paneli','Edge of the window'=>'Oyna cheti','Top'=>'Eng yuqori','Bottom'=>'Pastki','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar pastga aylantirganda oyna ostida ko\'rsatiladi.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar pa