s'=>'Rasmlarni o\'zgartirish','Choose at least two images.'=>'Kamida ikkita rasm tanlang.','Seconds per image'=>'Har bir rasm uchun soniyalar','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Sekin masshtablash (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Slayderni o\'chirish','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Oʻz qurilmasida harakatni kamaytirishni soʻragan tashrif buyuruvchilar faqat birinchi rasmni koʻradilar.','Section effects'=>'Bo\'lim effektlari','Top divider'=>'Yuqori ajratuvchi chiziq','Bottom divider'=>'Pastki ajratuvchi','Choose the logo'=>'Logotipni tanlang','Not set'=>'Oʻrnatilmagan','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Brend ranglarini tekshiring: har biri o\'ziga xos nom va yaroqli rangga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','Brand name'=>'Brend nomi','A logo is chosen.'=>'Logotip tanlandi.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Sayt dizayni sahifasidan logotipni tanlang.','Brand colours'=>'Brend ranglari','Brand %d'=>'Brend %d','Add brand colour'=>'Brend rangini qo\'shish','Heading font'=>'Sarlavha shrifti','Body font'=>'Asosiy shrift','Tone of voice'=>'Ovoz ohangi','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Brendingiz qanday yozadi, masalan, “Do\'stona va sodda, qisqa jumlalar, atamalarsiz.” sun\'iy intellekt ushbu sayt uchun har safar yozganda unga amal qiladi.','Brand kit saved.'=>'Brend to‘plami saqlandi.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'Brend qo\'llandi: uning ranglari, shriftlari va logotipi endi saytniki.','Apply to site'=>'Saytga qo\'llash','All classes'=>'Barcha sinflar','Class name on the page'=>'Sahifadagi sinf nomi','Printed as %s.'=>'%s sifatida chop etildi.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Harf bilan boshlang‘; faqat kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislar.','Styles'=>'Uslublar','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Uslub boshqaruvlari yuklanmadi. Sahifani qayta yuklang; agar muammo saqlanib qolsa, plaginni qayta o‘rnating.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'Sinf saqlandi. Undan foydalanadigan har bir element yangi uslubga ega.','Save class'=>'Sinflni saqlash','Class created.'=>'Sinf yaratildi.','New class'=>'Yangi sinf','e.g. Card'=>'masalan: Karta','Create'=>'Yaratish','Search classes'=>'Sinf qidirish','No class matches.'=>'Mos keladigan sinf yo\'q.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Hozircha sinflar yo\'q. YARATING, uslub bering va so\'zlamalaridan istalgan elementga qo\'shing.','Edit %s'=>'%s-ni tahrirlash','Class duplicated.'=>'Sinf nusxalandi.','Delete %s'=>'%s ni o\'chirish','Class deleted.'=>'Klass o‘chirildi.','Delete'=>'O‘chirish','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'"%s" sinfini o\'chirishni xohlaysizmi? Undan foydalanadigan elementlar o\'z kontentini saqlab qoladi, lekin uslublarini yo\'qotadi.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Faqat filtrlashdan oʻtmagan HTML qoʻshish huquqiga ega boʻlgan foydalanuvchilaragina maxsus CSS\'ni oʻzgartira oladi.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Ushbu CSS\'ning ayrim qismlari ishlatilmaydi: xavfsizlik maqsadida @import, expression(), javascript: URL\'lari, "<" va muvozanatsiz qavslar olib tashlanadi.','Upload a font'=>'Shriftni yuklash','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Shriftlarni yuklash uchun WordPress 6.5 yoki undan keyingi versiyasi talab qilinadi.','Font name'=>'Shrift nomi','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'masalan: Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s yuklandi va foydalanishga tayyor.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Shrift faylini tanlang (%s)','Font library'=>'Shriftlar kutubxonasi','%d files'=>'%d ta fayl','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Sayt uchun shrift o\'chirilgan.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Sayt uchun shrift yoqildi.','Switch off'=>'O‘chirish','Switch on'=>'Yoqish','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Adobe Fonts veb-loyihangizning kit ID raqamini kiriting. Shundan so\'ng uning shriftlari sahifalaringizga Adobe\'dan yuklanadi.','Your web projects'=>'Sizning veb-loyihalaringiz','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts ullandi.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts uzluki uzildi.','Kit id'=>'To\'plam identifikatori','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" uchun qorong‘i qiymat yaroqli rang emas.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Mehmon tanlamaganda','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchining qurilmasiga ergashish','Dark colours'=>'To\'q ranglar','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Har bir rang uchun qorong‘i versiyasini ko‘rsating. Bo‘sh qoldirilgan ranglar ikkala rejimda ham o‘zgarmasdan qoladi. Qorong‘i rejim kamida bitta rang uchun qorong‘i qiymat kiritilganda yoqiladi.','Dark version of %s'=>'%s ning qorong‘i versiyasi','Dark mode saved.'=>'Qora rejim saqlandi.','Page CSS'=>'Sahifa CSS','Global classes'=>'Global klasslar','Classes'=>'Sinflar','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Sayt dizaynida sinflar yarating, so\'ngra ularni shu yerga qo\'shing.','Custom CSS'=>'Maxsus CSS','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Ushbu element uchun qoidalar yozing. "selector" ushbu elementni bildiradi, masalan, selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — oddiy e\'lonlar elementining o\'ziga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Shrift fayllari %s bo\'lishi kerak.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Bu shrift fayli bo\'sh yoki hajmi 10 MB dan katta.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Bir marta uslub bering, hamma joyda qayta foydalaning, bir joyda o\'zgartiring.','Variables'=>'O\'zgaruvchilar','Named values any element can use.'=>'Har qanday element foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan nomlangan qiymatlar.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Oraliq masofa, radius va soyalar','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Har bir oraliq, burchak va soyani tanlash vositasi taqdim etadigan masshtablar.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Buni xohlaydigan tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun ranglaringizning qorong‘i versiyasi.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt va shablonlar tomonidan ishlatiladigan logotip, ranglar, shriftlar va ohang.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'O\'z shriftlaringizni yuklang yoki Adobe Fonts\'ni ulang.','CSS for this page only.'=>'Faqat ushbu sahifa uchun CSS.','CSS for this page'=>'Ushbu sahifa uchun CSS','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Faqat ushbu sahifada, sayt uslublaridan keyin yuklanadi. Sahifa bilan birga saqlanadi.','Short name'=>'Qisqa nom','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'"%s" qisqa nomi ikki marta ishlatilgan.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": qisqa nomlarda kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan foydalaniladi.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'"%s" qiymati ushbu sozlama tomonidan qabul qilinmaydi.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Qadam qo\'shish','Scales saved.'=>'Masshtablar saqlandi.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Masshtablar odatiy qiymatlarga qaytarildi.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Standart masshtablarga tiklash','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Hozircha o\'zgaruvchilar yo\'q. O\'zgaruvchi bitta qiymatni — kenglik, ranglar aralashmasi, shrift o\'lchamini — ko\'plab elementlar bo\'lishadigan qiymatni saqlaydi.','Add variable'=>'O\'zgaruvchi qo\'shish','Variables saved.'=>'O\'zgaruvchilar saqlandi.','Place ID'=>'Joylashuv ID','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Google Place ID qidiruvchisi yordamida toping: biznesingizni qidiring va ID\'ni nusxalang.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Places API (New) yoqilgan Google Cloud loyihangizdan API kaliti. Uni faqat shu API bilan cheklang.','Business unit ID'=>'Biznes bo‘linmasi identifikatori','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'Trustpilot Business hisob qaydangizdagi (Integrations › API) Trustpilot\'dagi biznesingizning 24 belgidan iborat identifikatori.','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Trustpilot Business hisob qaydangizning API kaliti.','Not set up.'=>'Sozlanmagan.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Saqlangan kalitni endi o\'qib bo\'lmaydi (saytning xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni qaytadan kiriting.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Ham ID, ham API kaliti talab qilinadi.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Sozlash. Google sharhlari Sharhlar bloki mavjud bo\'lgan sahifa har safar ko\'rilganda jonli ravishda yuklanadi: har bir ko\'rish uchun o\'zingizning kalitingiz bo\'yicha bitta Joy tafsilotlari so\'rovi, hech qachon saqlanmaydi (Google shartlari ularni saqlashga ruxsat bermaydi).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Birinchi yangilanish muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Birinchi yangilanish kutilmoqda (bir yoki ikki daqiqa ichida).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'Yangilandi %1$s: %2$d ta sharh saqlab qolindi, bahosi %3$s (%4$d ta sharh asosida).','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Oxirgi urinish (%1$s) muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi va yuqoridagi sharhlar saqlanib qoldi: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'Saqlandi. Trustpilot sharhlari bir-ikki daqiqada fonda yuklab olinadi; Google sharhlari sahifada jonli ravishda yuklanadi.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Trustpilot sharhlari fond rejimida kuniga bir marta olinib, saytingizda saqlanadi, shuning uchun gavjum sahifa Trustpilot hisobingizga qo\'shimcha xarajat keltirmaydi; agar yangilash muvaffaqiyatsiz tugasa, oxirgi sharhlar qoladi. Google o\'z sharhlarini saqlashga ruxsat bermaydi, shuning uchun ular tashrif buyuruvchi sahifani ko\'yganda jonli ravishda yuklanadi: har bir ko\'rish Google tomonidan haq to\'lanadigan o\'zingizning Google kalitingizdagi bitta so\'rovdir.','Where to find it'=>'Uni qayerdan topish mumkin','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'Saqlandi (…%s). Uni almashtirish uchun yangisini kiriting.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'%s tafsilotlarini va uning sharhlarini olib tashlash','Refreshed.'=>'Yangilandi.','Refresh now'=>'Hozir yangilash','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Keyingi kunlik yangilanish: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Google va Trustpilot tafsilotlaringiz, Sharhlar bloki uchun.','No colours yet.'=>'Hozircha ranglar yo\'q.','Colour %d'=>'Rang %d','Add colour'=>'Rang qo‘shish',